# Migrations & jobs

## Alembic

- Run from `backend/`: `poetry run alembic …`
- Autogenerate is a draft — verify enums, FK `ondelete`, symmetric `downgrade()`.
- New PG enum values: hand-write `ALTER TYPE … ADD VALUE`; downgrade often no-op.

## Jobs

- One-shot via `poetry run python scripts/run_job.py <name>` (Railway Cron). Names in `app/jobs/names.py`.
- Idempotent; JSON summary on stdout; persist `job_runs`.
- Do not expand stage gating or product rules without PRODUCT ask + gap/cluster approach.
- Cadence and ops: [`DEPLOYMENT.md`](DEPLOYMENT.md), [`ARCHITECTURE.md`](ARCHITECTURE.md) §7.
